• if Erz| xts is approximated by z (the outcome), then we get the classical supervised learning procedure in
Equation (16.97).
• if Erz| xts is approximated by Ppxt 1, wq (the following prediction), then we get the extreme TD method,
TDp0q.
Remark 16.2 The key point is that the real goal is for each prediction to match the expected value of the subsequent
outcome, not the actual outcome occurring in the training set. That is, the actual outcome of a sequence is often not
the best estimate of its expected value.
