1. The Real Time Recurrent Learning (RTRL) (see Robinson et al. [1987], Williams et al. [1989]).
2. The Backpropagation Through Time (BPTT) (see Werbos [1990], Williams et al [1992]).
In ordrer to describe the learning algorithm of the RNN and detail its associated problems, we focus on the BPTT, as
