on the ability to shape multi-stable attractor dynamics that reﬂect the multiplicity of solutions.
Remark 17.6 The attractors we try to ﬁt are the different ﬁlters we may use to denoise the initial signal. For instance,
it can correspond to several wavelets, decomposition and thresholding levels.
