Suppose that we observe stable states x on the training and validation samples. In these samples we can use all the
information at any time, so that we can ﬁt a ﬁltering technique such as wavelets and feed the reservoir using the ﬁltered
inputs only. The states should then be relatively stable on the training and validation, as previously discussed. Then,
using Equation ( 17.123) (for both Wout and Wres), we teach the network to ﬁt this ﬁltered dynamics. At the end of
