Note, the SVP problem is equivalent to empirical risk minimisation (ERM) with Tikhonov regularisation, where the
loss function is the hinge loss Lpx, yq  maxp0, xyq. Thus, SVM is closely related to other fundamental classiﬁcation
algorithms, where the main difference is in the choice of the loss function.
